<doc id="153362" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=153362" title="Urwah bin Zubair">
Urwah bin Zubair

Urwah bin Zubair ya iku ulama saka golongan &lt;a href="tabingin"&gt;tabingin&lt;/a&gt;. Asma pepake Urwah bin az-&lt;a href="Zubair%20bin%20al-Awwam"&gt;Zubair bin al-Awwam&lt;/a&gt; bin Khuwailid bin Asad bin Abdul Uzza bin Qushai al-Kurès. Urwah bin Zubair kalebu salah siji saka &lt;a href="pitu%20ahli%20pekih%20Madinah"&gt;pitu ahli pekih Madinah&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Kun-yah"&gt;Kun-yah&lt;/a&gt;e Abu Abdillah. Urwah kalairake ing taun 23 H, lan panemu liya nerangake 29 H, saka ibu &lt;a href="Asma%27%20binti%20Abu%20Bakar"&gt;Asma' binti Abu Bakar&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika wis diwasa, Urwah nandang lelara kang njalari salah siji sikile kudu di&lt;a href="amputasi"&gt;amputasi&lt;/a&gt; wates gares. Urwah seda ing taun 93 utawa 94 H.
<h2>Guru lan muride</h2>
Guru lan muride.
Urwah nyesep ilmu agama saka ramane, &lt;a href="Zubair%20al-Awwam"&gt;Zubair al-Awwam&lt;/a&gt; sedulure &lt;a href="Abdullah%20bin%20az-Zubair"&gt;Abdullah bin az-Zubair&lt;/a&gt;, ibune &lt;a href="Asma%27%20binti%20Abu%20Bakar"&gt;Asma' binti Abu Bakar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ali%20bin%20Abi%20Thalib"&gt;Ali bin Abi Thalib&lt;/a&gt;, Said bin Zaid bin Amr, Hakim bin Nizam, &lt;a href="Zaid%20bin%20Tsabit"&gt;Zaid bin Tsabit&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Abdullah%20bin%20Ja%27far"&gt;Abdullah bin Ja'far&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Abdullah%20bin%20Abbas"&gt;Abdullah bin Abbas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Abdullah%20bin%20Umar"&gt;Abdullah bin Umar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Abdullah%20bin%20Amr%20bin%20Al-Ash"&gt;Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Ash&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Usamah%20bin%20Zaid"&gt;Usamah bin Zaid&lt;/a&gt;, Abu Ayyub, &lt;a href="Abu%20Hurairah"&gt;Abu Hurairah&lt;/a&gt;, Hajjaj al-Aslami, lan akeh maneh saka para sakabat.
Dene para mjuride antarane anak-anake: Abdullah, Utsman, Hisyam, Muhammad lan Yahya, para putune, az-Zuhri, Ibnu Abi Mulaikah, &lt;a href="Umar%20bin%20Abdul%20Aziz"&gt;Umar bin Abdul Aziz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sulaiman%20bin%20Yasar"&gt;Sulaiman bin Yasar&lt;/a&gt;, Abu Salamah bin Abdurrahman, lan akeh maneh liyane.
