<doc id="153366" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=153366" title="Muhammad bin Sirin">
Muhammad bin Sirin

Muhammad bin Sirin ya iku salah siji &lt;a href="ulama"&gt;ulama&lt;/a&gt; saka golongan &lt;a href="tabingin"&gt;tabingin&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng pepake Muhammad bin Sirin al-Anshari Abu Bakar bin Abu Amrah al-Bashri. Dilairake ing 2 taun pungkasan paprentahane &lt;a href="Umar%20bin%20Khattab"&gt;Umar bin Khaththab&lt;/a&gt;, ana uga kang nerangake 2 taun pungkasan paprentahane &lt;a href="Utsman%20bin%20Affan"&gt;Utsman bin Affan&lt;/a&gt;.A&lt;a href="adz-Dzahabi"&gt;adz-Dzahabi&lt;/a&gt; luwih sarujuk panemu sing keri amarga ibnu Sirin pancen luwih enom tinimbang &lt;a href="Hasan%20al-Bashri"&gt;Hasan al-Bashri&lt;/a&gt;. Dene sedane ing taun 110 H, satus dina sawise &lt;a href="Hasan%20al-Bashri"&gt;Hasan al-Bashri&lt;/a&gt; seda.
