<doc id="153368" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=153368" title="Ibnu Syihab az-Zuhri">
Ibnu Syihab az-Zuhri

Ibnu Syihab az-Zuhri ya iku salah siji &lt;a href="ulama"&gt;ulama&lt;/a&gt; saka golongan &lt;a href="tabingin"&gt;tabingin&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng pepake Muhammad bin Muslim bin Ubaid bin Abdullah bin Syihab bin Abdullah bin al-Harits bin Zuhrah bin Kilab bin Murrah bin Kaab bin Luai bin Ghalib, cekake cukup disebut az-Zuhri. Lair taun 50 H utawa 51 H. Az-Zuhri meguru marang &lt;a href="Anas%20bin%20Malik"&gt;Anas bin Malik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sahl%20bin%20Saad"&gt;Sahl bin Saad&lt;/a&gt;, Abdurrahman bin Azhar, Mahmud bin ar-Rabai al-Anshari, &lt;a href="Abdullah%20bin%20Umar"&gt;Abdullah bin Umar&lt;/a&gt; lan as-Saib bin Yazid. Imam az-zuhri dipuntepang ugi dados ulami ahli tafsir lan ahli fikih.
Imam az-zuhri wedal wonten ing Syam (saniki Suriah) ing masa pamarintahan Dinasti Abbasiyah. Piyambakipun wedal saking keluwargi sugih ingkang dermawan. Malah piyambakipun mboten nate ngetang banda kekayaanipun ingkang dipun belanjaaken kangge urusan agami, kemajengan umat, lan elmi kawruh.
