<doc id="153374" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=153374" title="Thawus bin Kaisan">
Thawus bin Kaisan

Thawus bin Kaisan ya iku ulama saka golongan &lt;a href="tabingin"&gt;tabingin&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng pepake Thawus bin Kaisan al-Yamani al-Himyari. &lt;a href="adz-Dzahabi"&gt;adz-Dzahabi&lt;/a&gt; ngendikakae menawa Thawus lair ing jamane &lt;a href="Utsman"&gt;Utsman&lt;/a&gt; utawa sadurungé. Thawus meguru marang para &lt;a href="sakabat"&gt;sakabat&lt;/a&gt;, antarane &lt;a href="Jabir%20bin%20Abdillah"&gt;Jabir bin Abdillah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Abdullah%20bin%20Abbas"&gt;Abdullah bin Abbas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Abdullah%20bin%20Umar"&gt;Abdullah bin Umar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Abu%20Hurairah"&gt;Abu Hurairah&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Aisyah"&gt;Aisyah&lt;/a&gt;. Dene muride antarane &lt;a href="Wahb%20bin%20Munabbih"&gt;Wahb bin Munabbih&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Atha%20bin%20Abi%20Rabah"&gt;Atha bin Abi Rabah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Amr%20bin%20Dinar"&gt;Amr bin Dinar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mujahid"&gt;Mujahid&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Laits%20bin%20Abi%20Salim"&gt;Laits bin Abi Salim&lt;/a&gt;. Thawus seda ing Makkah ing taun 106 H.
