<doc id="153385" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=153385" title="Abdullah bin Mubarak">
Abdullah bin Mubarak

Abdullah bin al-Mubarak ya iku ulama saka golongan &lt;a href="tabiut%20tabi%27in"&gt;tabiut tabi'in&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng pepake Abdullah bin al-Mubarak bin Wadhih al-Hanzali at-Tamimi. Lair ing taun 118 H lan seda ing sasi Ramelan 181 H.
&lt;a href="Ibnu%20al-Jauzi"&gt;Ibnu al-Jauzi&lt;/a&gt; ngendikakae menawa Abdullah bin Mubarak ketemu pira-pira &lt;a href="tabingin"&gt;tabingin&lt;/a&gt; antarane &lt;a href="Hisyam%20bin%20Urwah"&gt;Hisyam bin Urwah&lt;/a&gt;, Ismail bin Abu Khalid, &lt;a href="al-A%27masy"&gt;al-A'masy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sulaiman%20at-Taimi"&gt;Sulaiman at-Taimi&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyane.
Dene muride antarane &lt;a href="Sufyan%20ats-Tsauri"&gt;Sufyan ats-Tsauri&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ma%27mar%20bin%20Rasyid"&gt;Ma'mar bin Rasyid&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sufyan%20bin%20Uyainah"&gt;Sufyan bin Uyainah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Fudhail%20bin%20Iyadh"&gt;Fudhail bin Iyadh&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Rujukan</h2>

