<doc id="153386" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=153386" title="Fudhail bin Iyadh">
Fudhail bin Iyadh

Al-Fudhail bin Iyadh ya iku ulama kalebu &lt;a href="tabiut%20tabi%27in"&gt;tabiut tabi'in&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng pepake al-Fudhail bin Iyadh bin Mas'ud bin Bisyr at-Tamimi. Lair taun 107 H ing &lt;a href="Samarkad"&gt;Samarkand&lt;/a&gt;, sawise diwasa bajur meyang &lt;a href="Kufah"&gt;Kufah&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Makkah"&gt;Makkah&lt;/a&gt;. Dene sedane taun 186/187 H.
Fudhail bin Iyadh meguru marang &lt;a href="al-A%27masy"&gt;al-A'masy&lt;/a&gt;, Ubaidullah bin Umar, Hisyam bin Hasan, Yahya bin Said al-Ashari, Muhammad bin Ishaq, lan liya-liyane. Dene muride atarane &lt;a href="Sufyan%20ats-Tsauri"&gt;Sufyan ats-Tsauri&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sufyan%20bin%20Uyaiah"&gt;Sufyan bin Uyaiah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Abdullah%20bin%20Mubarak"&gt;Abdullah bin Mubarak&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyane.
