<doc id="153387" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=153387" title="Sufyan bin Uyainah">
Sufyan bin Uyainah

Sufyan bin Uyainah ya iku ulama saka golongan &lt;a href="tabiut%20tabigin"&gt;tabiut tabigin&lt;/a&gt;. Dilairake ing taun 107 H lan seda ing sasi Rejeb 198 H. Guru-gurune antarane Abdul Malik bin Umair, Abu Ishaq as-Sa'bi, Ziyad bin Ilaqah, al-Aswad bin Qais, Aban bin Taghlib lan liya-liyane. Dene muride atarane &lt;a href="al-A%27masy"&gt;al-A'masy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ibnu%20Juraij"&gt;Ibnu Juraij&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Syu%27bah"&gt;Syu'bah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ats-Tsauri"&gt;ats-Tsauri&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Waki%27"&gt;Waki',&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Muhammad%20bin%20Idris%20asy-Syafi%60i"&gt;asy-Syafi'i&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yahya%20bin%20Qaththan"&gt;Yahya bin Qaththa&lt;/a&gt;n, &lt;a href="Ahmad%20bin%20Hanbal"&gt;Ahmad bin Hanbal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yahya%20bin%20Ma%27in"&gt;Yahya bin Ma'in&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ali%20bin%20al-Madini"&gt;Ali bin al-Madini&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ishaq%20bin%20Rahawaih"&gt;Ishaq bin Rahawaih&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyane.
