<doc id="153389" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=153389" title="Waki'">
Waki'

Waki' bin al-Jarrah bin Malih ar-Ru'asi ya iku ulama saka golongan &lt;a href="tabiut%20tabingin"&gt;tabiut tabingin&lt;/a&gt;. Lair ing taun 129 H la seda ing taun197 H sawise nindakake ibadah &lt;a href="kaji"&gt;kaji&lt;/a&gt;.
Guru-gurune atarane &lt;a href="Ibnu%20Juraij"&gt;Ibnu Juraij&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="al-Auza%27i"&gt;al-Auza'i&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Malik%20bin%20Anas"&gt;Malik bin Anas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ats-Tsauri"&gt;ats-Tsauri&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Syu%27bah"&gt;Syu'bah&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyane. Dene muride kaya ta &lt;a href="ats-Tsauri"&gt;ats-Tsauri&lt;/a&gt; (kang uga dadi gurune), &lt;a href="Abdurrahman%20bin%20Mahdi"&gt;Abdurrahman bin Mahdi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Abu%20Hanifah"&gt;Abu Hanifah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Musaddad"&gt;Musaddad&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyane.
