<doc id="153390" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=153390" title="Yahya bin Ma'in">
Yahya bin Ma'in

Yahya bin Ma'in ya iku ulama saka abad ke-2 Hijriyah. Yahya dilairake ing taun 158 H lan &lt;a href="Adz-Dzahabi"&gt;Adz-Dzahabi&lt;/a&gt; ngendika menawa Yahya bin Ma'in wis nulisake ilmu hadits nalika umur 20 taun lan Yahya bin Ma'in kang paling tuwa saka ulama kang saangkatan, kayadene &lt;a href="Ali%20bin%20al-Madini"&gt;Ali bin al-Madini&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ahmad%20bin%20Hanbal"&gt;Ahmad bin Hanbal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ishaq%20bin%20Rahawaih"&gt;Ishaq bin Rahawaih&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Abu%20Bakar%20bin%20Abu%20Syaibah"&gt;Abu Bakar bin Abu Syaibah&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Abu%20Khaitsamah"&gt;Abu Khaitsamah&lt;/a&gt;. Dene &lt;a href="Imam%20Ahmad"&gt;Imam Ahmad&lt;/a&gt; ngendika "Yahya bin Ma'in wong kang paling limpad ing babagan para &lt;a href="rawi"&gt;rawi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="kadis"&gt;kadis&lt;/a&gt;. 
Yahya bin Ma'in meguru marang &lt;a href="Abdullah%20bin%20Mubarak"&gt;Abdullah bin Mubarak&lt;/a&gt;, Husyaim, Ismail bin Ayyasy, Abbad bin Abbad, &lt;a href="Sufyan%20bin%20Uyainah"&gt;Sufyan bin Uyainah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ghundar"&gt;Ghundar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Waki%27"&gt;Waki'&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yahya%20bin%20al-Qahthan"&gt;Yahya bin al-Qahthan&lt;/a&gt; lan liya-liyane saka negara &lt;a href="Irak"&gt;Irak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hijaz"&gt;Hijaz&lt;/a&gt;, Jazirah, &lt;a href="Syam"&gt;Syam&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mesir"&gt;Mesir&lt;/a&gt;. Dene muride kaya ta &lt;a href="Imam%20Bukhari"&gt;Imam Bukhari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Imam%20Muslim"&gt;Imam Muslim&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Abu%20Dawud"&gt;Abu Dawud&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyane. 
Yahya bin Ma'in seda ing sasi Dulkaidah 233 H ing Madinah nalika arep budhal nindhakake &lt;a href="kaji"&gt;kaji&lt;/a&gt;.
