<doc id="153392" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=153392" title="Sulaiman bin Mihran">
Sulaiman bin Mihran

Sulaiman bin Mihran utawa luwih kawentar kanthi jejuluk Al-A'masy ya iku ulama generasi &lt;a href="tabingin"&gt;tabingin&lt;/a&gt; kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Thabaristan"&gt;Thabaristan&lt;/a&gt; lan pindhah menyang &lt;a href="Kufah"&gt;Kufah&lt;/a&gt; nalika isih bocah. Piyambakipun air ing taun 61 H lan ketemu pira-pira &lt;a href="sakabat"&gt;sakabat&lt;/a&gt; kaya ta &lt;a href="Ibnu%20Mas%27ud"&gt;Ibnu Mas'ud&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Anas%20bin%20Malik"&gt;Anas bin Malik&lt;/a&gt; sahengga kalebu golongané tabingin anom. Déné kang ngriwayataké kadis saka al-A'masy kaya ta &lt;a href="ats-Tsauri"&gt;ats-Tsauri&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ibnu%20Uyainah"&gt;Ibnu Uyainah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ibnu%20al-Mubarak"&gt;Ibnu al-Mubarak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Fudhail%20bin%20Iyadh"&gt;Fudhail bin Iyadh&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyané.
Al-A'masy seda ing taun 148 H.
