<doc id="153408" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=153408" title="OpenSUSE">
OpenSUSE

OpenSUSE iku salah sijining sistem operasi komputer bebas lan terbuka adhedhasar kernel Linux. Proyek openSUSE disponsori dening perusahaan SUSE Linux GmbH sing pusate ono ing negoro Jerman. Paket aplikasi openSUSE awujud paket RPM lan nganggo sistem manajemen paket sing jenenge YAST. openSUSE minongko sistem operasi sing dikembangke dening proyek komunitas wiwit dirilis ing tahun 2005 kanthi jeneng SUSE Linux. Rilisan stabil terakhir, yoiku openSUSE Leap 15.6, dirilis sasi Juni 2024&lt;a href="https%3A//en.opensuse.org/openSUSE%3ARoadmap"&gt;[1&lt;/a&gt;]. Proyek komunitas openSUSE ugo nggawe versi rolling release sing dijenengi openSUSE Tumbleweed.
