<doc id="155453" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=155453" title="Kagubernuran Dohuk">
Kagubernuran Dohuk

Kagubernuran Dohuk (&lt;a href="Basa%20Kurdhi"&gt;Kurdhi&lt;/a&gt;: پارێزگای دھۆک‎, &lt;a href="Basa%20Syriac"&gt;Syriac&lt;/a&gt;: ܗܘܦܲܪܟܝܵܐ ܕܕܸܗܘܟ‎, &lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: محافظة دهوك‎‎ Muḥāfaẓat Dahūk) ya iku sawijining &lt;a href="Kagubernuran%20ing%20Irak"&gt;kagubernuran&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Kurdhistan%20Irak"&gt;Kurdhistan Irak&lt;/a&gt;. Kutha krajané ya iku kutha &lt;a href="Dohuk"&gt;Dohuk&lt;/a&gt;. Ing njeroné uga ana kutha &lt;a href="Zakho"&gt;Zakho&lt;/a&gt;, sing ing manéka kasempatan tau dadi &lt;a href="titik%20pamriksan%20ing%20tapal%20wates"&gt;titik pamriksan&lt;/a&gt; ing tapal watesé &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;. Sadurungé taun 1976, wewengkon iki dadi pérangan saka &lt;a href="Kagubernuran%20Nineveh"&gt;Kagubernuran Nineveh&lt;/a&gt;, sing dikenal minangka Kagubernuran Mosul. Kagubernuran Dohuk akèh-akèhé didunungi déning &lt;a href="wong%20Kurdhi"&gt;wong Kurdhi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="wong%20Asiria"&gt;wong Asiria&lt;/a&gt;, kanti sawenèh &lt;a href="wong%20Yasidhi"&gt;wong Yasidhi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="wong%20Arm%C3%A9nia%20ing%20Irak"&gt;wong Arménia&lt;/a&gt;. Ing taun 2017, cacah wongé diwatara ana 1.511.585 kanthi 15% akèh-akèhé ngrasuk agama Kristen (akèh-akèhé &lt;a href="wong%20Asiria"&gt;wong Asiria&lt;/a&gt;).
