<doc id="157055" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=157055" title="Bathik jeron nagara">
Bathik jeron nagara

&lt;a href="Bathik"&gt;Bathik&lt;/a&gt; jeron negara ya iku salah sawijining bathik saka &lt;a href="Banyumas"&gt;Banyumas&lt;/a&gt;. Motif bathik iki manéka warna kaya déné motif plonto galaran seling parang klithik, godhong lumbu, jahè serimpang, lan &lt;a href="ayam"&gt;ayam&lt;/a&gt; puger, onèngan, parang gandhasubrata, parang gandhasuli, lan madubronto.
Motif bathik salem motif kopi pecah, manggar, merak, ukel kangkung, sinar rantai kanthi ciri khas warna ireng lan putih.
